+- **Learnings for future iterations:**
+  - Soft tracked metrics still need a closed `quota_resource` entry when they are visible through usage APIs or billing export snapshots.
+  - For Traefik request-rate metrics, derive rates from adjacent counter samples and aggregate by service/interval before taking the peak; a whole-window average is not a production-grade `peak_1m` signal.
+  - `MetricDefinition.BillingGrade=false` should not make the emitter skip a metric when the PRD requires durable customer visibility.
