ich catalog row a future tier-upgrade regression watches. Always grep the route registration in routes.go AND the existing contract test's OpenAPI assertion to confirm which action a route is gated on before writing the policy matrix. Forward-applicable to every future CapRead-on-{X}-resolver matrix where the underlying row carries no credential material (org_grants, members, audit_events, etc.): keep the four-test skeleton, swap action+resource Kind, and drop the secret-plaintext anchor + Sentinel-projection assertion.
